# Every image is built from the repository root and pruned with turbo, so the
# context is the repo. Keep it to what a build reads: no installs, no build
# output, no secrets, no history.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
packages/database/generated
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
*.md
!apps/www/assets/**/*.md
